Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:57:09 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 19/41] bitproxy: notification controls; slower auto-pick tests

Notifications card on the BitProxy screen: turn new-app prompts on/off,
turn the live speed in the VPN notification on/off (upstream setting),
jump straight to the VPN notification's channel to hide it (the VPN
keeps running), and to all notification settings. BitProxy's channels
are now named 'VPN start errors' and 'New app prompts'.

Auto-pick (urltest) tests servers every 10 minutes instead of 3; each
test wakes the radio for every server.
